OL,3,AFunding set to double for plan to get
OL,4,Arough sleepers off streets by Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FFunding is set to double to support a
OL,7,Fpledge by the prime minister to give
OL,8,Fevery rough sleeper in England a route
OL,9,Foff the streets by Christmas.
OL,11,FEnding rough sleeping was one of Andy
OL,12,FBurnham's first promises when he
OL,13,Fentered Downing Street, announcing a
OL,14,F#442m package to provide emergency
OL,15,Faccommodation and practical support.
OL,17,FOn the eve of the first Rough Sleeping
OL,18,FSummit at Downing Street on Monday, No
OL,19,F10 has indicated a further #432m will
OL,20,Fbe added to the initiative in
OL,21,FWednesday's Budget.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
