OL,3,AFunding set to double for plan to get
OL,4,Arough sleepers off streets by Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FShadow housing secretary Katie Lam said
OL,7,Frough sleeping had hit "record highs
OL,8,Funder Labour" and criticised Burnham
OL,9,Ffor failing to end rough sleeping when
OL,10,Fhe was the Mayor of Greater Manchester.
